.\" urweb man page - POSIX/GNU-style
.Dd March 10, 2025
.Dt URWEB 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm urweb
.Nd Ur/Web compiler and project tool
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Op Fl V | Fl -version
.Nm
.Cm new
.Op Fl -lib
.Ar project-name
.Nm
.Cm build
.Nm
.Cm fmt
.Op Fl -check
.Op Fl w Ns Ar N | Fl -width Ns Ar N
.Op Ar file ...
.Nm
.Cm install
.Ar author/repo
.Nm
.Cm daemon
.Cm start | stop
.Nm
.Op Ar flag ...
.Ar project-name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
compiles Ur/Web applications and provides project management commands.
Ur/Web is a domain-specific functional language for web applications with
SQL backends.
.Pp
.Ss Subcommands
.Bl -tag -width "daemon start|stop"
.It Cm new Op Cm --lib Ar project-name
Create a new application or library project.
.It Cm build
Build the project in the current directory (requires urweb.toml).
.It Cm fmt Op Ar files...
Format .ur and .urs source files.
.It Cm install Ar author/repo
Install a package via git submodule (e.g. urweb/upo).
.It Cm daemon Cm start | Cm stop
Start or stop the development daemon.
.El
.Pp
.Ss Compiler Flags
When
.Ar project-name
is given, the following flags are supported:
.Bl -tag -width "-output, --output=file"
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print usage and exit.
.It Fl V , Fl -version
Print version and exit.
.It Fl -ccompiler Ar prog
Set the C compiler.
.It Fl -dbms Ar engine
Select database: sqlite, mysql, or postgres.
.It Fl -db Ar connstr
Database connection string.
.It Fl -prefix Ar prefix
URL prefix for the application.
.It Fl -sql Ar file
Output SQL DDL to file.
.It Fl o , Fl -output , Fl -output Ns = Ns Ar file
Output executable to file.
.It Fl -tc
Stop after type checking.
.It Fl -debug
Save intermediate C files.
.It Fl -verbose
Verbose output.
.It Fl -boot
Use build tree; generate statically linked executables.
.El
.Pp
For the full list of compiler flags, run
.Nm Fl -help .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "URWEB"
.It Ev SRCLIB
Override library search path (default: /usr/local/lib/urweb).
.It Ev COMPILER_LIB
Override compiler library path.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Lk https://www.impredicative.com/ur/
The Ur/Web project.
.Sh AUTHORS
Adam Chlipala and contributors.
